Region	Meadow	14	18	27	26
Region	Yard	3	11	13	20
Region	Hall	3	2	11	8
Region	Gallery	10	6	24	12
[Trigger]
Name	dayBreak
Mode	once
Cond	time	2
Action	message	1	Master, the rock around your heart is soft. Send the workers into the walls and bring out the gold.
Action	objective	1	Strike down Reeve Tobin Marsh in his village hall.
Action	objective	1	First, mine 60 gold from the walls around your heart.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	firstGold
Mode	once
Cond	mined	1	>=	60
Action	message	1	The first coins are in. A hatchery will feed the creatures that come to serve you.
Action	objective	1	Claim the meadow cave west of the gate.
Action	generate	1	Goblin:1
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	meadowOurs
Mode	once
Cond	claimed	1	Meadow	18
Action	message	1	The meadow cave is ours. Two cave roads lead to the village now, one over the moss and one past the old stones.
Action	reveal	1	Yard
Action	objective	1	Defeat the watch post in the village yard.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	postStirs
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Yard
Action	message	1	The watchmen have seen you. One of them is running to wake the reeve.
Action	spawn	3	11	14	1	Adventurer:1	Adventurer:1
Action	setflag	yardAlarm	1
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	hallOpened
Mode	once
Cond	flag	yardAlarm	1
Cond	kills	1	>=	3
Action	message	1	The yard is quiet. Only the reeve and his hall are left.
Action	reveal	1	Hall
Action	objective	1	Enter the hall and slay the reeve.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	firstRelief
Mode	once
Cond	time	540
Action	message	1	Riders from the next farm are coming down the road. There are only a few.
Action	spawn	3	12	10	1	Adventurer:1	Adventurer:1
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	secondRelief
Mode	once
Cond	time	1100
Action	message	1	The reeve has sent word to the hills. Another band is on its way.
Action	spawn	3	20	11	1	Adventurer:1	Adventurer:1	Monk:1
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	reeveFalls
Mode	once
Cond	time	5
Cond	creatures	2	<=	0
Action	message	1	Reeve Marsh has fallen. Mossgate has no one left to ring the bell.
Action	win	1
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	reeveWavers
Mode	once
Cond	health	ReeveMarsh	<	40
Action	message	1	The reeve is bleeding and calling for the last of his watch.
Action	spawn	3	8	6	1	Adventurer:1	Adventurer:1
[/Trigger]
[/Triggers]
